<title>POLAND: Boryszew sees '97 net up to PLN 10.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Boryszew sees '97 net up to PLN 10.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical company Boryszew SA expects to lift its net profit to 10.4 million zlotys in 1997, up from last year's nine million, the company said in its issue prospectus.</p>
<p>Boryszew said its sales should grow to 121 million zlotys from 109.4 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
